+								D3DTEXOPCAPS_SELECTARG1 |					// The D3DTOP_SELECTARG1 texture-blending operation is supported. 
+								D3DTEXOPCAPS_SELECTARG2 |					// The D3DTOP_SELECTARG2 texture-blending operation is supported. 
